{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ30WTDYJKVSXZ3WX1F"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ30WTDYJKVSXZ3WX1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ44CP3TX2G02GRJG28"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ5NCNRK5W0E6Q252Y3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ6A8VGQHK17CD7HM7P"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ7RY5ANH090599VMW4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ8THDJWF8MA5RCVX2V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ9V6RJ5PMJ9B9VHR5J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJADFVDHF31HBS7M354"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJBFQNRNPY5RK4CETE0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJCXPBF035EQCDNADMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJDTG5VWMF8SF8CGN08"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJEWRGVG6MP4G8M0ZG5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJF66TCBX5MW90K9RY7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJGWA6AHQ2KBC3667SX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJH9EX72EC28WHF48Y2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJJZRS4WWBXGGSTF9PG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJKD5R1X9HDVQT3HE3R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJMZ201FJAQX6ZSKM4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJN8N3Y81A3CZZ12SDW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJPFNTCJ4RMV5S72GK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJQQVAA1Q54F4T0M0S3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJR0TDP9DRNZMZF22RB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJSGSZ60RTESPQY7XVZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJT0WC8D41KJHHNJCTB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJV8PD9X910S0FPK5TR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJW1SK1JZFQG600JG2Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJXSX1J6JYGK1ZWA8T4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJYHJ2HW9490ZRVP1HP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJZ10CV8FG09HV4BH36"}]},"id":"01M6S74NK02SCSMP35HGR6JBGA","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-03","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the price of coherence, paid in sameness","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ44CP3TX2G02GRJG28"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ7RY5ANH090599VMW4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJQQVAA1Q54F4T0M0S3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJV8PD9X910S0FPK5TR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJZ10CV8FG09HV4BH36"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YN14HRJCEVFSBB1SNPM"}],"prose":"Many self-governing parts are asked to act as one, and the paper tries this again and again: through shared meaning, through values given bodies, through a coordinator, and through rehearsal. Each attempt pays for coherence with some loss of each part's own shape, and pays differently.","title":"Holding together without making alike"},"id":"01M6S74NJ30WTDYJKVSXZ3WX1F","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether joining demands structural change","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ5NCNRK5W0E6Q252Y3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ6A8VGQHK17CD7HM7P"},{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"}],"prose":"The starting lack is wholes that cannot work with other wholes unless someone changes their structure. The idea of the nested part arrives with a history and with a list of what lone autonomy fails at.","title":"A gap where joining means rebuilding"},"id":"01M6S74NJ44CP3TX2G02GRJG28","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which ground the idea has been carried into","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"From a philosopher's double-faced entity to factory cells, power grids, building sites and data pipelines, the same figure of part-and-whole keeps being moved into new ground.","title":"The nested part travels"},"id":"01M6S74NJ5NCNRK5W0E6Q252Y3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"}],"prose":"Systems that decide by themselves break when conditions shift, inherit skewed judgement, cannot answer for harm, and see too little of their surroundings; twins and learning are offered as the missing feed.","title":"What autonomy alone gets wrong"},"id":"01M6S74NJ6A8VGQHK17CD7HM7P","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which plane carries the binding","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ8THDJWF8MA5RCVX2V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJCXPBF035EQCDNADMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJH9EX72EC28WHF48Y2"}],"prose":"Coherence is sought on three planes at once: what things mean between parts, what a decision must respect, and who has the last word. The planes lean on each other.","title":"Three planes of holding together"},"id":"01M6S74NJ7RY5ANH090599VMW4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where agreement about meaning lives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ9V6RJ5PMJ9B9VHR5J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJADFVDHF31HBS7M354"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJBFQNRNPY5RK4CETE0"}],"prose":"Agreement on what data means can be imposed from a shared model or worked out at the moment two parts meet; the paper sides with the second and gives parts an interior able to interpret.","title":"Meaning made between, not above"},"id":"01M6S74NJ8THDJWF8MA5RCVX2V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much representation must be shared","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KHNG089YY6CPCTVEGP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"Everyone adopts one format, everyone maps to a common layer, or each pair translates as needed with nothing shared; the last keeps parts free but asks most of the moment of contact.","title":"Three ways to agree"},"id":"01M6S74NJ9V6RJ5PMJ9B9VHR5J","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a semantic contract lives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"A vocabulary built for one exchange, one episode, one task phase, then dropped or revised; a contract of sense with a lifetime.","title":"Meaning that expires"},"id":"01M6S74NJADFVDHF31HBS7M354","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a part can read what reaches it","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"}],"prose":"Some parts are given ontologies and reasoning so they can turn mixed, noisy input into a picture of the situation before deciding.","title":"A part that can interpret"},"id":"01M6S74NJBFQNRNPY5RK4CETE0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which quality is given a body of its own","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJDTG5VWMF8SF8CGN08"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJEWRGVG6MP4G8M0ZG5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJF66TCBX5MW90K9RY7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJGWA6AHQ2KBC3667SX"}],"prose":"Fairness, ethics, a long view and watchfulness are not left as properties of the whole; each becomes a kind of part with its own job, and the parts feed one another.","title":"Values given bodies"},"id":"01M6S74NJCXPBF035EQCDNADMT","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision must not violate","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093DCQMTYP12QJRK0KEX9"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094GAF5Q516BRBZPKAK33"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased parts stand beside decisions as checks, encoding rules, harm limits and known patterns of skew, and auditing outcomes in loans, hiring, vehicles and triage.","title":"Guards on a decision"},"id":"01M6S74NJDTG5VWMF8SF8CGN08","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon a goal is judged over","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"Getting a goal done cheaply is set against getting it done well over time; the difference is carried by weighing many criteria and by measures that are still to be invented.","title":"The longer horizon"},"id":"01M6S74NJEWRGVG6MP4G8M0ZG5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment of local knowledge with global state","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"Parts that know their own corner can still be wrong together; watchful parts spread awareness of the whole state across levels so local choices line up.","title":"Shared watchfulness"},"id":"01M6S74NJF66TCBX5MW90K9RY7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between kinds of part","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S094Z96KNZDEW5TXAHT8KF"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"}],"prose":"The value-bearing parts form a small economy: guards pass verdicts to the long-view part, interpreters supply context, watchers span every level, and conflicts among them go up to be negotiated.","title":"How the organs feed one another"},"id":"01M6S74NJGWA6AHQ2KBC3667SX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where the final say actually sits","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJJZRS4WWBXGGSTF9PG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJKD5R1X9HDVQT3HE3R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJMZ201FJAQX6ZSKM4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJN8N3Y81A3CZZ12SDW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJPFNTCJ4RMV5S72GK8"}],"prose":"A dedicated part binds the rest while promising to leave their insides alone; yet the same part is named the top with the highest say, and its watchers are called orchestrators.","title":"The coordinator that says it does not rule"},"id":"01M6S74NJH9EX72EC28WHF48Y2","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's inside stays untouched","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S0966QJ26TRP3SYCMVVJ1G"},{"$ref":"01M6S09680J8SGQ5QP5F1RE969"},{"$ref":"01M6S096B57TAE58492Y73TJPX"},{"$ref":"01M6S096BM94C19GPA5W8TZCDX"},{"$ref":"01M6S096CKGYTCWVA3S2R2HD5Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S096DHFQXC5GW9PKDMVG57"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6S096JM086986QX3E3WZWJ1"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"Joining is negotiated at runtime so each part keeps its own logic, models and scope; the coordinator works at the level of meaning and organisation and leaves the wires to others.","title":"Federation as untouched interiors"},"id":"01M6S74NJJZRS4WWBXGGSTF9PG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which function is handed to which component","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"The binding part is itself a small whole: a deciding orchestrator, a graph of what can connect to what, a translator, a finder, a planner of workflows and their runner, with language models suggested for the first and third.","title":"The coordinator's own organs"},"id":"01M6S74NJKD5R1X9HDVQT3HE3R","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"rank within the nesting","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"}],"prose":"Despite distributed authority, rank reappears: the top sets directives, the coordinator is superholon with the highest say, and the simulation's manager answers upward to it.","title":"The pyramid returns"},"id":"01M6S74NJMZ201FJAQX6ZSKM4P","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"cost of mediation as parts multiply","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"}],"prose":"Translating and reasoning at every meeting slows with numbers, needs agreed protocols nobody yet has, and carries sensitive traffic that must be guarded and recorded.","title":"What mediation costs as it grows"},"id":"01M6S74NJN8N3Y81A3CZZ12SDW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether order is designed or arises","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Alongside the designed top runs the older thought that whole-scale order can arise from local interaction with no one in charge.","title":"Pattern from below"},"id":"01M6S74NJPFNTCJ4RMV5S72GK8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the simulated also directs","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJR0TDP9DRNZMZF22RB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJSGSZ60RTESPQY7XVZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJT0WC8D41KJHHNJCTB"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned around: the parts being simulated also steer the run, and the live system is mirrored in a federation of stand-ins that check its answers.","title":"Parts that rehearse themselves"},"id":"01M6S74NJQQVAA1Q54F4T0M0S3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited from the agent tradition","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"}],"prose":"The ways agents are simulated, help simulation and watch over it are carried over wholesale to holons, which add nesting to agents' autonomy.","title":"Inherited from agents"},"id":"01M6S74NJR0TDP9DRNZMZF22RB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of influence over the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092TSGGXA8WG36SRK5TND"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092XTJ4DM3B12H6CFN807"}],"prose":"From parts that only supply data, through ones that react and learn, to ones that rewrite the run's rules and goals.","title":"Grades of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NJSGSZ60RTESPQY7XVZ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between a stand-in and its holon","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate twin on a shared runtime; a manager twin answers to the coordinator, discrepancies are flagged upward and invalidate results, and time management keeps the doubles in step.","title":"The federation's double"},"id":"01M6S74NJT0WC8D41KJHHNJCTB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who is left without a way to move","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NJW1SK1JZFQG600JG2Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJXSX1J6JYGK1ZWA8T4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJYHJ2HW9490ZRVP1HP"}],"prose":"Everything above is cast onto sparse rural transport, where the thing to be found is often an absence.","title":"One countryside as the trying ground"},"id":"01M6S74NJV8PD9X910S0FPK5TR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"locating gaps rather than serving demand","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the system is asked to locate places with no means of travel, by noticing where requests fail and which zones people avoid.","title":"Finding absence"},"id":"01M6S74NJW1SK1JZFQG600JG2Q","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which dimension each actor wears","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"Concrete actors put on the abstract dimensions: travellers as interpreters, transport services as fair and far-sighted, infrastructure as watchers, a communication part as translator, the coordinator as orchestrator.","title":"Casting the roles"},"id":"01M6S74NJXSX1J6JYGK1ZWA8T4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
